-     * costs one tick each.
+     * Advance only when another packet follows: a single-packet response
+     * keeps the exact 0113b timing (load here, DATAEND on the next tick).
+     * Vendor writes the next packet from the context that saw the
+     * TXPKTRDY-clear event; leaving it to the service tick costs a tick
+     * per packet.
      */
-    ruby_ep0_tx_pump(mac, t);
+    if (total > n)
